  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Nigeria&#x2019;s AfCFTA Export Readiness: Empowering MSMEs for Intra-Africa Trade</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The African Continental Free Trade Area (AfCFTA) presents a transformative opportunity for Nigeria to diversify its economy and lead the continent in inclusive, sustainable trade-driven growth. With a market of 1.27 billion people &#x2013; projected to grow to 1.7 billion by 2030 &#x2013; and a potential GDP of USD 6.7 trillion in purchasing power parity terms, AfCFTA can reshape Africa&#x2019;s economic landscape. For Nigeria, the agreement opens a strategic pathway to unlock the potential of its micro, small, and</narrative>
  </description>
